1
00:02:04,358 --> 00:02:07,748
No living creature was harmed
during the filming of this show.

2
00:02:08,826 --> 00:02:10,816
İznik Castle

3
00:02:11,967 --> 00:02:15,467
Episode 71

4
00:02:37,026 --> 00:02:39,356
My bey, drink.

5
00:03:03,674 --> 00:03:05,804
Aygül! Aygül!

6
00:03:06,642 --> 00:03:09,072
Aygül, give it to Cerkutay.

7
00:03:25,557 --> 00:03:28,277
Move out!
I have the antidote!

8
00:04:15,398 --> 00:04:17,728
No one leaves!

9
00:04:23,338 --> 00:04:24,968
Hold the gate!

10
00:04:34,301 --> 00:04:35,680
My bey!

11
00:04:35,680 --> 00:04:37,440
You are well, thank Allah!

12
00:04:37,877 --> 00:04:40,197
I am.

13
00:04:48,939 --> 00:04:51,659
I trusted Kumral Abdal fully.

14
00:04:54,414 --> 00:04:57,974
There, they can only make
hemlock poison.

15
00:04:58,711 --> 00:05:01,571
And this is the cure.
Even a sip...

16
00:05:02,030 --> 00:05:04,750
is enough to heal you.

17
00:05:08,980 --> 00:05:11,820
Don't eat or drink anything
in the Governor's palace.

18
00:05:13,271 --> 00:05:16,511
I'll put a bread on my bag and eat
it if needed, my bey.

19
00:05:22,272 --> 00:05:24,302
If they attempt on some treachery...

20
00:05:25,514 --> 00:05:27,303
we are under your protection.

21
00:05:27,303 --> 00:05:29,063
Sure, my bey.

22
00:07:31,319 --> 00:07:33,229
Drink this.

23
00:07:45,215 --> 00:07:47,015
Drink it!

24
00:07:53,292 --> 00:07:54,862
Take it!

25
00:08:16,847 --> 00:08:18,257
Drink it!

26
00:08:27,629 --> 00:08:29,389
Catch her!

27
00:09:25,448 --> 00:09:28,378
Orhan, don't be afraid.

28
00:09:30,612 --> 00:09:34,582
We are being raided!
Alps! We are being raided!

29
00:09:52,826 --> 00:09:56,096
You all will die today!

30
00:10:03,627 --> 00:10:06,570
You baseborn! Allah creates
and destroys, not you!

31
00:10:06,570 --> 00:10:08,510
Whose dog are you?

32
00:10:32,430 --> 00:10:34,060
Gonca?

33
00:10:36,250 --> 00:10:37,670
Gonca!

34
00:10:37,755 --> 00:10:41,295
Alps! Come, we are being raided!

35
00:11:06,719 --> 00:11:08,239
Mother?

36
00:11:10,587 --> 00:11:12,147
What is it?

37
00:11:12,793 --> 00:11:15,533
I feel a distortion, son.

38
00:11:16,345 --> 00:11:18,905
I wanted to check around.

39
00:11:21,325 --> 00:11:22,935
What is this, mother?

40
00:11:23,655 --> 00:11:27,565
Don't you know?
I'm always like this.

41
00:11:27,913 --> 00:11:29,652
It's a caution.

42
00:11:29,652 --> 00:11:32,272
Let's go together, then.

43
00:11:32,717 --> 00:11:34,577
It'll ease your heart.

44
00:12:04,855 --> 00:12:06,405
A strong girl.

45
00:12:11,637 --> 00:12:14,257
This poison should've killed you.

46
00:12:19,401 --> 00:12:21,181
No! No!

47
00:12:22,671 --> 00:12:25,771
Gonca! No! Gonca!
No!

48
00:12:36,449 --> 00:12:39,199
Gonca! Gonca! Gonca!

49
00:12:44,236 --> 00:12:46,076
Gonca, get up!

50
00:12:48,289 --> 00:12:49,389
Gonca!

51
00:12:52,748 --> 00:12:54,608
Your friend is dead.

52
00:12:54,890 --> 00:12:57,160
Now it's your turn.

53
00:12:58,216 --> 00:13:01,306
Not you, I want the ones holding
your leashes.

54
00:13:10,150 --> 00:13:12,420
Where are the guards?

55
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:18,230
Mother, these aren't from our tribe.
Protect yourself.

56
00:13:18,654 --> 00:13:22,604
Alps! There is an infiltration!
Come on!

57
00:13:28,408 --> 00:13:30,588
Come on, Julia! Come on!

58
00:13:57,608 --> 00:13:59,228
Mother!

59
00:14:00,493 --> 00:14:02,353
Mother!

60
00:14:31,753 --> 00:14:33,303
Orhan!

61
00:14:38,605 --> 00:14:40,375
Alps!

62
00:15:01,665 --> 00:15:03,835
We won't survive this.

63
00:15:16,365 --> 00:15:18,155
Gonca!

64
00:15:19,645 --> 00:15:21,105
Gonca!

65
00:15:21,280 --> 00:15:24,050
Gonca, open your eyes!

66
00:15:26,999 --> 00:15:29,059
Kick the door!

67
00:15:30,830 --> 00:15:32,970
Are you alright? Bala?
Mother?

68
00:15:34,024 --> 00:15:37,584
We are alright. Gonca is in a
bad condition.

69
00:15:38,141 --> 00:15:40,171
Gonca!

70
00:15:40,302 --> 00:15:42,752
They infiltrated the tribe for this!

71
00:15:49,824 --> 00:15:51,714
Come on!

72
00:16:03,925 --> 00:16:06,005
She cut the tent and left, my bey!

73
00:16:06,199 --> 00:16:09,451
You won't return before finding her!

74
00:16:09,451 --> 00:16:11,171
-As you order, my bey.
-Come on!

75
00:16:11,778 --> 00:16:13,361
She is bleeding heavily!

76
00:16:13,361 --> 00:16:16,621
Carry her to her tent!
We need to tend her wounds!

77
00:16:16,712 --> 00:16:19,562
I'll find Kumral.
Come on, Master Davud!

78
00:16:19,674 --> 00:16:21,584
Alps!

79
00:16:24,935 --> 00:16:27,865
Come on! Bring it!

80
00:16:28,388 --> 00:16:31,748
Hang on Gonca!
Hang on!

81
00:16:31,868 --> 00:16:36,038
İznik Castle

82
00:16:46,024 --> 00:16:47,974
Your wound seems alright, my bey.

83
00:16:48,069 --> 00:16:50,249
It'll be healed in no time.

84
00:16:50,994 --> 00:16:53,874
We saved our tribe.

85
00:16:55,896 --> 00:16:58,646
This is better than any cure.

86
00:16:59,857 --> 00:17:01,837
I miss Orhan.

87
00:17:01,837 --> 00:17:03,687
Oh, yeah.

88
00:17:05,060 --> 00:17:07,300
So do I.

89
00:17:08,181 --> 00:17:10,121
But her mother Bala...

90
00:17:10,151 --> 00:17:12,171
doesn't see him any different than
her own.

91
00:17:12,327 --> 00:17:14,166
-She looks after him.
-I know.

92
00:17:16,432 --> 00:17:18,172
But know that...

93
00:17:20,387 --> 00:17:22,637
we are exploring for Orhan.

94
00:17:23,678 --> 00:17:28,458
What we see, what we know is
all for Orhan.

95
00:17:32,269 --> 00:17:35,619
These lands that we are in
as guests today...

96
00:17:36,728 --> 00:17:38,948
will be made our home by Orhan.

97
00:17:43,411 --> 00:17:47,151
This is the sacred cause of the Turks.

98
00:17:50,133 --> 00:17:54,863
Malhun, now you are in the future lands
of the Turks.

99
00:17:56,622 --> 00:17:58,852
You said well.

100
00:17:59,083 --> 00:18:02,403
May Allah destine us to see
those days.

101
00:18:03,862 --> 00:18:05,532
Amin.

102
00:18:10,828 --> 00:18:14,578
Brother, I want to return to our
home safely.

103
00:18:16,329 --> 00:18:18,419
I am separated from my loved one.

104
00:18:19,001 --> 00:18:21,051
I miss her.

105
00:18:22,274 --> 00:18:25,754
Brother, you have sister Gonca waiting
for you.

106
00:18:26,660 --> 00:18:29,830
What should I do?
I'm returning to an empty tribe.

107
00:18:30,780 --> 00:18:34,910
Göktuğ, it doesn't fit a man
to be single.

108
00:18:36,005 --> 00:18:39,115
Two kinds of love is good for heart;
love of your country...

109
00:18:39,205 --> 00:18:41,285
and love of a woman.

110
00:18:43,714 --> 00:18:44,994
And...

111
00:18:47,032 --> 00:18:49,232
there is the love of a child, of course.

112
00:18:50,638 --> 00:18:52,928
Add the love of a nephew.

113
00:18:52,964 --> 00:18:55,414
I want to be an uncle, Boran.

114
00:18:56,013 --> 00:18:58,613
Inshallah, brother.
Inshallah.

115
00:19:02,331 --> 00:19:03,611
Göktuğ.

116
00:19:05,481 --> 00:19:07,711
I want to be a father.

117
00:19:08,386 --> 00:19:10,786
Inshallah, brother.
Inshallah.

118
00:19:33,671 --> 00:19:35,931
-Is it ready?
-It is.

119
00:19:43,480 --> 00:19:45,280
Allah is healing.

120
00:19:54,089 --> 00:19:55,759
Allah is healing.

121
00:20:13,970 --> 00:20:16,020
May I enter, Selcan Hatun?

122
00:20:24,389 --> 00:20:26,099
Come in.

123
00:20:34,146 --> 00:20:36,736
Kumral Abdal, is the arrow poisonous?

124
00:20:37,750 --> 00:20:39,970
The arrow seems to be poisonous.

125
00:20:41,424 --> 00:20:44,564
That's why all alps fell down.

126
00:20:45,148 --> 00:20:47,418
Thank Allah, there is an antidote.

127
00:20:47,738 --> 00:20:50,088
Kumral! Kumral!

128
00:20:51,908 --> 00:20:54,038
Her wound is deep.

129
00:20:55,170 --> 00:20:57,770
We take caution, Allah makes the decision.

130
00:21:18,818 --> 00:21:20,298
Come on, my girl.

131
00:21:21,136 --> 00:21:22,726
Come on.

132
00:21:26,521 --> 00:21:27,931
Mother?

133
00:21:28,634 --> 00:21:30,794
You are also wounded.

134
00:21:32,986 --> 00:21:36,976
I'm alright. What can a small
wound do to me?

135
00:21:38,567 --> 00:21:42,207
Turn to your jobs.
Take Orhan to sleep.

136
00:21:45,282 --> 00:21:47,702
With the name of Allah.

137
00:21:49,835 --> 00:21:52,365
-Is it enough?
-It is.

138
00:21:55,059 --> 00:21:57,999
Mother. Mother, let me check your wound.

139
00:22:02,233 --> 00:22:05,223
-I'm alright, my child.
-We need to fire it.

140
00:22:14,692 --> 00:22:16,932
Harmankaya Castle

141
00:22:18,789 --> 00:22:23,809
That Gregor deceived all the folks
and gave my village to Osman!

142
00:22:24,504 --> 00:22:26,821
Why do you think he'll
work with us?

143
00:22:26,821 --> 00:22:29,851
Because, he is a priest, Nikola.

144
00:22:30,225 --> 00:22:32,945
Before anything, he is a good Christian.

145
00:22:33,148 --> 00:22:36,708
Of course, he'll stand with us against
our eternal enemies.

146
00:22:37,038 --> 00:22:40,488
I don't think so, Kosses.
Where is Priest Gregor now?

147
00:22:40,707 --> 00:22:42,425
With Osman.

148
00:22:42,425 --> 00:22:45,605
Understand it, Nikola!

149
00:22:46,948 --> 00:22:49,718
This is the war between the cross
and the crescent.

150
00:22:50,286 --> 00:22:54,876
Priest Gregor would rather die than
stand with the Turks.

151
00:23:11,934 --> 00:23:13,934
We couldn't get the relic, sir.

152
00:23:19,179 --> 00:23:23,129
As you see, nothing we do works.

153
00:23:24,636 --> 00:23:27,506
We need that priest!

154
00:23:28,089 --> 00:23:30,739
-Summon Samuel.
-Right away.

155
00:23:42,775 --> 00:23:44,735
Believe me, Nikola.

156
00:23:44,986 --> 00:23:48,086
If Priest Gregor stands with us...

157
00:23:48,589 --> 00:23:51,199
with the Flying Fire I have...

158
00:23:51,313 --> 00:23:55,323
I'll create such a gap in Osman's
heart that...

159
00:23:56,188 --> 00:23:58,448
it won't be possible to repair it.

160
00:24:09,389 --> 00:24:12,889
-Sir.
-I want you to go to Priest Gregor.

161
00:24:13,390 --> 00:24:21,440
We need him to destroy Söğüt. And all
lords are waiting for him under the cross.

162
00:24:30,327 --> 00:24:32,347
İznik Castle

163
00:24:32,347 --> 00:24:35,917
You saved my life last night, Osman Bey.

164
00:24:36,294 --> 00:24:38,844
I can't thank you enough.

165
00:24:43,359 --> 00:24:48,399
Your roads are dangerous,
and so is your castle.

166
00:24:49,971 --> 00:24:51,471
Thank Allah...

167
00:24:53,119 --> 00:24:55,329
against all traps...

168
00:24:56,994 --> 00:24:58,944
we have a caution.

169
00:25:06,624 --> 00:25:12,044
For this reason, I'm happy to gain
a friend like you.

170
00:25:27,919 --> 00:25:29,769
Thank you.

171
00:25:30,855 --> 00:25:33,985
Then let's not leave these words
as just words.

172
00:25:35,430 --> 00:25:39,030
If you are so happy to agree
with us...

173
00:25:42,256 --> 00:25:44,756
then pay the coins in advance.

174
00:25:49,992 --> 00:25:53,672
Pay it so that our trade will get
bountiful.

175
00:26:04,298 --> 00:26:06,988
I believe that I'll make more.

176
00:26:08,462 --> 00:26:13,122
Let's have it your way.
Let our trade get bountiful.

177
00:26:16,858 --> 00:26:18,938
Thank you.

178
00:26:19,864 --> 00:26:21,834
Don't worry.

179
00:26:22,293 --> 00:26:24,953
Nothing wrong will happen in İznik.

180
00:26:28,770 --> 00:26:32,970
Both your roads and your goods
are safe with me.

181
00:26:39,768 --> 00:26:42,298
The last verse you learned.

182
00:26:42,776 --> 00:26:45,486
''Humans can't only live with bread...

183
00:26:45,848 --> 00:26:49,138
they live with all the words that
God said.''

184
00:26:51,014 --> 00:26:52,974
Petrus.

185
00:26:53,994 --> 00:26:55,424
Petrus.

186
00:26:56,557 --> 00:27:02,177
Every day, you get closer to be
the saint warrior of the christ.

187
00:27:04,483 --> 00:27:06,193
You are great, kids.

188
00:27:06,209 --> 00:27:08,669
You finished your training.

189
00:27:09,063 --> 00:27:12,223
Now, to become better christians...

190
00:27:12,945 --> 00:27:18,265
Monk Antuan will take you to
St. Beatrice Abby.

191
00:27:26,440 --> 00:27:30,500
It's been eight years since we took them
away from their tribes.

192
00:27:31,072 --> 00:27:33,842
You've done a great job.

193
00:27:34,510 --> 00:27:38,720
You raised Turkmen children
as good Christians.

194
00:27:38,856 --> 00:27:40,196
I'm grateful.

195
00:27:40,196 --> 00:27:43,416
I'm always ready to serve the holy cross.

196
00:27:49,203 --> 00:27:51,813
The christ's love.

197
00:27:52,321 --> 00:27:55,001
When it's fully in their hearts...

198
00:27:56,073 --> 00:28:00,653
we can place the holy cross
anywhere we want.

199
00:28:13,275 --> 00:28:16,745
Don't tell me you returned, empty-handed.

200
00:28:28,954 --> 00:28:30,654
I couldn't take it.

201
00:28:30,802 --> 00:28:33,082
I'm only left with two men.

202
00:28:49,908 --> 00:28:51,998
What is a child, Julia?

203
00:28:59,200 --> 00:29:01,410
A child is a future.

204
00:29:02,094 --> 00:29:04,004
A child is a seed.

205
00:29:04,451 --> 00:29:09,681
A child is a root of a greening tree.

206
00:29:12,203 --> 00:29:16,253
We will take the root before it
greens.

207
00:29:16,667 --> 00:29:20,247
We'll take Osman's dreams.

208
00:29:23,261 --> 00:29:28,731
Tomorrow, this place will be filled
with Turkmen children.

209
00:29:31,442 --> 00:29:34,402
There are children getting education
in Söğüt.

210
00:29:35,074 --> 00:29:37,284
They came from the Kayı Tribe.

211
00:29:38,777 --> 00:29:42,737
They are yours. You will kidnap
them.

212
00:29:44,451 --> 00:29:47,961
And my men will take care of the
children of the other tribes.

213
00:29:49,669 --> 00:29:52,389
I want everything that will hurt them!

214
00:29:53,741 --> 00:29:55,721
This will hurt them well.

215
00:29:56,175 --> 00:29:57,905
You can be sure of that.

216
00:30:31,219 --> 00:30:34,159
Bala, get some rest.

217
00:30:34,468 --> 00:30:36,518
I'll stay here.

218
00:30:38,063 --> 00:30:40,463
I need to be here when Gonca
opens her eyes.

219
00:30:40,463 --> 00:30:43,673
If you don't think for yourself,
think for your baby.

220
00:30:45,693 --> 00:30:47,683
It's your responsibility.

221
00:30:47,683 --> 00:30:48,603
Come on.

222
00:30:58,054 --> 00:31:00,374
What will I say to Boran now?

223
00:31:07,327 --> 00:31:09,297
I hope it's good, Boran.

224
00:31:09,609 --> 00:31:11,439
Something is up.

225
00:31:11,505 --> 00:31:14,105
Let's see, brother.

226
00:31:21,474 --> 00:31:23,284
Bala?

227
00:31:26,666 --> 00:31:28,416
What is this?

228
00:31:28,778 --> 00:31:30,738
Bala, what is this?
Tell me!

229
00:31:31,889 --> 00:31:34,929
Brother, tell me!

230
00:31:46,840 --> 00:31:48,330
Gonca.

231
00:31:48,750 --> 00:31:50,220
Gonca!

232
00:31:54,989 --> 00:31:56,961
-Orhan!
-Where is Orhan?

233
00:31:56,961 --> 00:31:58,891
Tell me!

234
00:31:59,488 --> 00:32:01,298
Orhan is well.

235
00:32:05,381 --> 00:32:07,171
Osman Bey.

236
00:32:07,737 --> 00:32:09,817
We were raided last night.

237
00:32:12,701 --> 00:32:15,141
They infiltrated the tribe to take
the relic.

238
00:32:15,383 --> 00:32:16,983
They couldn't take it.

239
00:32:18,259 --> 00:32:20,189
But we have martyrs.

240
00:32:22,035 --> 00:32:24,065
And Gonca Hatun is severely wounded.

241
00:32:47,027 --> 00:32:48,777
Gonca!

242
00:32:49,114 --> 00:32:50,644
Gonca!

243
00:32:54,097 --> 00:32:55,747
Sister?

244
00:33:04,106 --> 00:33:06,226
Gonca, what did they do to you?

245
00:33:21,870 --> 00:33:24,290
I won't let them get away with this!

246
00:33:25,473 --> 00:33:27,683
Just get up to your feet.

247
00:33:28,108 --> 00:33:31,858
I will make them pay for he
pain they gave you!

248
00:33:33,786 --> 00:33:38,726
I will bury them one by one for
every drop of blood you lost.

249
00:33:47,685 --> 00:33:49,685
Boran.

250
00:33:51,803 --> 00:33:53,493
-You are here.
-I'm here.

251
00:33:55,773 --> 00:33:57,953
I'm here, my rose.

252
00:34:04,420 --> 00:34:06,460
But I'm late.

253
00:34:09,242 --> 00:34:11,452
I couldn't protect you.

254
00:34:12,260 --> 00:34:14,630
I couldn't be your shield.

255
00:34:18,568 --> 00:34:21,888
The sword they swang at you
cuts my heart, Gonca.

256
00:34:30,397 --> 00:34:32,877
Don't. Don't.

257
00:34:33,621 --> 00:34:37,291
Don't, Gonca.
Stay strong.

258
00:34:37,465 --> 00:34:38,855
Stay strong.

259
00:34:39,933 --> 00:34:41,422
Don't.

260
00:34:45,661 --> 00:34:47,982
You are here now.

261
00:34:49,261 --> 00:34:51,511
I see you now.

262
00:34:57,382 --> 00:34:59,672
Look at me.
Look at me.

263
00:35:01,983 --> 00:35:03,883
Just get to your feet...

264
00:35:04,150 --> 00:35:07,020
I promise that I will never
leave you again.

265
00:35:09,815 --> 00:35:12,925
You won't spend a day without seeing me.

266
00:35:13,123 --> 00:35:15,203
I swear.

267
00:35:29,245 --> 00:35:33,515
Their faces were masked,
their eyes were devil-like.

268
00:35:35,490 --> 00:35:37,610
They infiltrated the tribe.

269
00:35:37,820 --> 00:35:40,560
One of them, a woman...

270
00:35:42,488 --> 00:35:44,868
we protected ourselves...

271
00:35:44,919 --> 00:35:47,239
but we couldn't protect Gonca.

272
00:35:51,975 --> 00:35:54,175
I couldn't protect my sister, Osman.

273
00:35:56,353 --> 00:35:59,673
She protected Orhan, my baby
and me...

274
00:36:01,050 --> 00:36:03,180
but I couldn't protect her.

275
00:36:03,560 --> 00:36:07,330
Gonca is a strong woman, Bala.
She will be healed.

276
00:36:07,705 --> 00:36:09,245
She will be alright.

277
00:36:22,170 --> 00:36:23,950
Stand tall, Bala.

278
00:36:25,977 --> 00:36:28,297
We've been through many troubles.

279
00:36:35,694 --> 00:36:37,194
Söğüt

280
00:37:07,144 --> 00:37:10,144
Kids, take an apple!

281
00:37:10,872 --> 00:37:12,582
Slowly, slowly!

282
00:37:12,923 --> 00:37:14,443
Slowly!

283
00:37:44,686 --> 00:37:47,376
Which way is Sheik Edebali's lodge?

284
00:37:49,214 --> 00:37:52,784
You look like dervishes,
don't you know where the lodge is?

285
00:37:52,944 --> 00:37:56,094
We aren't from Söğüt but Engörü.

286
00:37:59,499 --> 00:38:01,849
Alright then.
Come with me.

287
00:38:02,593 --> 00:38:04,823
We aren't looking for the lodge
but you.

288
00:38:08,591 --> 00:38:10,821
Come here, little Turks!

289
00:38:27,008 --> 00:38:28,848
This won't kill you.

290
00:38:29,269 --> 00:38:32,689
But it will make you pass out.

291
00:38:54,718 --> 00:38:57,208
Hurry, hide them!

292
00:39:04,173 --> 00:39:06,543
Stop! Who are you?
Let the kids go!

293
00:39:26,958 --> 00:39:30,475
Gonca risked her life to protect us.

294
00:39:30,475 --> 00:39:33,305
Bala, Allah is healing.

295
00:39:33,659 --> 00:39:36,969
We'll take shelter under his name
and wait for the healing.

296
00:39:38,165 --> 00:39:41,355
Don't worry, Gonca will survive.

297
00:39:41,804 --> 00:39:43,704
I was so afraid, Osman.

298
00:39:44,208 --> 00:39:46,148
I was afraid for Orhan.

299
00:39:46,297 --> 00:39:47,907
For our baby.

300
00:39:47,970 --> 00:39:50,580
For losing the relics.

301
00:39:52,035 --> 00:39:54,285
Now I'm tested with my sister's life.

302
00:39:54,648 --> 00:39:56,368
My heart is pounding.

303
00:39:57,453 --> 00:40:01,253
Bala, I'll take their hearts out.

304
00:40:02,273 --> 00:40:06,763
But remove fear from your
pretty eyes.

305
00:40:12,780 --> 00:40:14,160
My bey.

306
00:40:14,539 --> 00:40:19,179
The heathens didn't attack us and the
tribe at the same time for nothing.

307
00:40:21,396 --> 00:40:25,196
It isn't one person's job...

308
00:40:25,662 --> 00:40:28,612
to attack our tribe and us.

309
00:40:29,729 --> 00:40:34,399
It seems that the heathens have united.

310
00:40:34,952 --> 00:40:39,072
It's our job to destroy them all at
where they are united.

311
00:40:39,540 --> 00:40:43,070
But firstly, we need to find the traitor
in the tribe.

312
00:40:45,044 --> 00:40:48,754
I changed the path on our way to İznik.

313
00:40:49,809 --> 00:40:52,289
But very few people knew of this.

314
00:40:55,513 --> 00:40:59,033
Priest Gregor's relic was also a secret.

315
00:41:01,604 --> 00:41:03,644
Do you say it's Gökçe?

316
00:41:03,925 --> 00:41:07,605
Only she was present when we talked
about the relic.

317
00:41:08,533 --> 00:41:10,643
She must've heard it.

318
00:41:10,813 --> 00:41:12,233
In my tent...

319
00:41:13,171 --> 00:41:14,971
she is with Orhan!

320
00:41:16,542 --> 00:41:21,017
If you knew that she would betray,
why didn't you say it, Malhun?

321
00:41:21,017 --> 00:41:23,458
She swore after the carpet
incident, my bey.

322
00:41:23,458 --> 00:41:26,708
She said that it was ignorance,
and we forgave her.

323
00:41:27,748 --> 00:41:31,558
It seems that we were the ignorant ones.

324
00:41:43,230 --> 00:41:45,460
If it's Gökçe who has done
this betreyal.

325
00:41:47,578 --> 00:41:50,268
Don't reveal your suspicion...

326
00:41:50,588 --> 00:41:52,798
before finding out her owner.

327
00:41:58,007 --> 00:41:59,859
This is your job.

328
00:41:59,859 --> 00:42:02,919
Our eyes are on her, my bey.
If you allow me.

329
00:42:07,039 --> 00:42:09,359
Don't worry, my bey.

330
00:42:10,274 --> 00:42:13,404
If you allow me, I want to be with Gonca.

331
00:43:20,954 --> 00:43:23,444
Tell me, Bahadır.
What happened?

332
00:43:23,551 --> 00:43:26,022
They were bloodthirsty, Malhun Hatun.

333
00:43:26,022 --> 00:43:29,742
We protected the tribe.
We beat them, thank Allah.

334
00:43:30,763 --> 00:43:33,483
And where was Gökçe?

335
00:43:37,638 --> 00:43:39,978
I can't say anything, Malhun Hatun.

336
00:43:40,663 --> 00:43:43,193
I couldn't tell who was where
during the fighting.

337
00:43:48,233 --> 00:43:51,433
Now listen to me nicely.

338
00:43:52,079 --> 00:43:54,919
Keep your eyes on Gökçe.

339
00:43:55,907 --> 00:43:59,967
What's wrong, Malhun Hatun? Did Gökçe
do something wrong?

340
00:44:00,541 --> 00:44:02,731
Do as I say, Bahadır.

341
00:44:02,758 --> 00:44:04,838
Keep your eyes on her.

342
00:44:05,086 --> 00:44:08,856
Where she goes, who she talks to;
inform me about everything.

343
00:44:18,353 --> 00:44:21,233
-I brought sherbet, my lady.
-Right here, Gökçe.

344
00:44:33,203 --> 00:44:35,644
Do as I said, Bahadır.

345
00:44:35,644 --> 00:44:39,734
As you command, Malhun Hatun.
Be at ease.

346
00:45:14,483 --> 00:45:16,773
Hurry!

347
00:45:20,666 --> 00:45:22,886
Tie them up!

348
00:45:31,453 --> 00:45:34,613
Give it to the guide leader of the smiths
in Söğüt.

349
00:45:34,760 --> 00:45:36,250
He should use it.

350
00:45:36,339 --> 00:45:39,028
And he should prepare the goods
at once.

351
00:45:39,028 --> 00:45:41,028
-As you order, master.
-Come on now.

352
00:46:06,543 --> 00:46:08,823
My bey, the kids!

353
00:46:10,061 --> 00:46:12,621
They kidnapped the kids from the mosque.

354
00:46:15,178 --> 00:46:17,338
Aytekin! My son!

355
00:46:17,338 --> 00:46:20,064
Ahmet! My Ahmet!

356
00:46:20,064 --> 00:46:21,734
Ahmet!

357
00:46:23,036 --> 00:46:24,846
My son! Bring me my son!

358
00:46:29,218 --> 00:46:31,828
They were already gone when
I woke up, my bey.

359
00:46:32,020 --> 00:46:35,750
The only thing I remember is that
they were led by a woman.

360
00:46:36,743 --> 00:46:40,323
It must be the same woman who
led the attackers here, brother.

361
00:46:43,627 --> 00:46:47,667
My bey, the kids getting schooling
from Dodurga Tribe didn't return.

362
00:46:48,185 --> 00:46:51,765
We are getting the same news from
the other tribes too, my bey.

363
00:46:52,761 --> 00:46:55,751
There were missing children from
near tribes before.

364
00:46:55,988 --> 00:46:57,878
They couldn't be found.

365
00:47:07,735 --> 00:47:09,555
Traitors.

366
00:47:11,745 --> 00:47:14,265
Treacherous dogs.

367
00:47:16,633 --> 00:47:19,763
They tried to fight us first.

368
00:47:20,471 --> 00:47:22,431
But they couldn't beat us.

369
00:47:22,470 --> 00:47:24,090
They weren't strong enough.

370
00:47:24,460 --> 00:47:28,550
Then, they did what fits them,
they plotted.

371
00:47:28,905 --> 00:47:30,979
They set traps.

372
00:47:30,979 --> 00:47:33,009
But they still couldn't
beat us.

373
00:47:33,289 --> 00:47:41,359
Now they are all united and they want
to take our innocent children.

374
00:47:42,707 --> 00:47:45,107
O' people!

375
00:47:48,174 --> 00:47:50,604
Be at ease!

376
00:47:51,273 --> 00:47:56,023
Even the mightiest of the heathen...

377
00:47:56,132 --> 00:48:01,632
is not strong enough to fight
the Turks and their children!

378
00:48:04,507 --> 00:48:06,027
Alps!

379
00:48:06,444 --> 00:48:08,444
Take caution.

380
00:48:08,811 --> 00:48:12,221
Take the most capable tracker alps
with you.

381
00:48:13,298 --> 00:48:17,538
You will attack all the lords' lands
as a wolf attacks a herd of sheep.

382
00:48:17,794 --> 00:48:19,334
As you order, my bey.

383
00:48:19,770 --> 00:48:23,360
But don't return before
finding a track.

384
00:48:24,019 --> 00:48:28,129
If those children of mine
gets hurt...

385
00:48:29,357 --> 00:48:33,347
they won't even be free
after entering their graves.

386
00:48:33,444 --> 00:48:35,444
Go on now!

387
00:48:36,159 --> 00:48:37,779
Go!

388
00:49:36,578 --> 00:49:39,578
I'm not afraid of you.
Kill me if you want.

389
00:49:42,194 --> 00:49:44,894
I could feed the animals with you.

390
00:49:45,187 --> 00:49:48,147
But I have to take you alive.

391
00:50:20,272 --> 00:50:22,662
Tie him.

392
00:50:23,398 --> 00:50:25,598
-Did anyone else run away?
-No, sir.

393
00:50:27,398 --> 00:50:29,118
Let's go.

394
00:50:53,710 --> 00:50:55,260
Come on!

395
00:51:05,049 --> 00:51:07,419
Osman Bey will find us.

396
00:51:15,463 --> 00:51:17,513
Söğüt

397
00:51:34,190 --> 00:51:37,570
Our co-religionists in Söğüt
are loyal to Osman.

398
00:51:38,661 --> 00:51:42,801
It won't be easy to sway them to
a rebellion.

399
00:51:42,964 --> 00:51:46,924
Even though it's difficult, I won't
let Muslims...

400
00:51:46,924 --> 00:51:49,864
pollute our lands any longer,Andreas.

401
00:51:57,056 --> 00:52:00,056
I brought the lords' regards.

402
00:52:02,256 --> 00:52:05,506
The lords are united under the
shadow of the holy cross.

403
00:52:05,506 --> 00:52:07,216
Go on.

404
00:52:07,652 --> 00:52:12,852
They want to make sure that you'll
use your influence to destroy Osman.

405
00:52:14,299 --> 00:52:18,799
Even our most merciless co-religionist
is better than a Turk.

406
00:52:20,239 --> 00:52:23,119
Tell them that I'll do my part.

407
00:52:33,259 --> 00:52:35,019
Be careful.

408
00:52:35,223 --> 00:52:38,683
The first part of this unity is
not getting caught.

409
00:52:47,375 --> 00:52:49,765
God heard our prayers, master.

410
00:52:51,630 --> 00:52:53,550
Soon, Osman.

411
00:52:54,122 --> 00:52:57,262
Christ's children will take
their revenge.

412
00:52:59,433 --> 00:53:01,883
İnegöl Castle

413
00:53:03,013 --> 00:53:04,503
İnegöl Streets

414
00:53:32,683 --> 00:53:34,413
You.

415
00:53:37,136 --> 00:53:39,206
What are you doing here?

416
00:54:12,986 --> 00:54:15,446
This will happen to your
master too!

417
00:54:18,445 --> 00:54:20,395
But not now.

418
00:54:35,686 --> 00:54:37,796
Bilecik Castle

419
00:54:41,248 --> 00:54:43,676
Brother, we can't return before
finding a track.

420
00:54:43,676 --> 00:54:46,576
We must search everywhere.

421
00:55:01,252 --> 00:55:04,434
Who are you? Who are these
children? What are you doing to them?

422
00:55:04,434 --> 00:55:07,144
They are kids from St.Marcus Orphanage.

423
00:55:07,687 --> 00:55:09,717
St.Marcus?

424
00:55:13,523 --> 00:55:15,173
Soldiers, help!

425
00:55:28,422 --> 00:55:30,532
Stop! Stop!

426
00:56:02,129 --> 00:56:04,209
Who do you think is the traitor?

427
00:56:06,641 --> 00:56:08,381
There are many.

428
00:56:09,435 --> 00:56:10,965
I don't know.

429
00:56:12,813 --> 00:56:16,053
But I know one thing.
If I find him...

430
00:56:16,460 --> 00:56:19,340
he'll know the price of
hurting the children.

431
00:56:46,771 --> 00:56:48,551
What did you find, Cerkutay?

432
00:56:53,363 --> 00:56:55,303
It's a child's shoe.

433
00:57:01,144 --> 00:57:03,354
And it's from our tribe.

434
00:57:09,124 --> 00:57:10,984
This way.

435
00:57:16,904 --> 00:57:18,464
It's Bilecik.

436
00:57:22,513 --> 00:57:25,568
-You will pay dearly for this!
-You will!

437
00:57:25,568 --> 00:57:28,458
You will!

438
00:57:41,262 --> 00:57:43,662
Alptekin, get up.

439
00:57:48,671 --> 00:57:52,341
Don't worry, Osman Bey will
save us.

440
00:57:55,135 --> 00:57:57,638
Aren't we Kayı's warriors?

441
00:57:57,638 --> 00:57:59,528
We are!

442
00:57:59,777 --> 00:58:04,317
We must haze these heathens
until Osman Bey comes.

443
00:58:05,960 --> 00:58:11,250
You are right, Ahmet Alp.
But we are out of strenght.

444
00:58:12,273 --> 00:58:15,103
Remember what Kumral Abdal told us.

445
00:58:15,784 --> 00:58:18,010
We have a never-ending power.

446
00:58:18,010 --> 00:58:20,560
We'll evade the heathens off with it.

447
00:58:20,579 --> 00:58:23,189
With the power of faith!
Allahu Akbar!

448
00:58:23,189 --> 00:58:35,489
Allahu Akbar!
Allahu Akbar!

449
00:58:39,840 --> 00:58:42,650
My spy is back from Söğüt.

450
00:58:45,271 --> 00:58:47,941
Priest Gregor agrees with us

451
00:58:48,639 --> 00:58:51,159
He wants Osman dead.

452
00:58:51,711 --> 00:58:54,371
And even more.

453
00:58:54,604 --> 00:58:58,054
Gentlemen, if Söğüt falls...

454
00:58:58,877 --> 00:59:00,777
so does Osman.

455
00:59:03,691 --> 00:59:06,581
Now, we are on the same ranks
with the priest.

456
00:59:06,684 --> 00:59:08,511
It's a great move, Kosses.

457
00:59:08,511 --> 00:59:11,381
But we need more.

458
00:59:12,894 --> 00:59:14,814
Naturally.

459
00:59:16,267 --> 00:59:18,997
That's why I did more.

460
00:59:20,109 --> 00:59:23,869
Children, the children of the Turks.

461
00:59:26,049 --> 00:59:27,619
I have them.

462
00:59:27,891 --> 00:59:30,841
I'll make them good Christians.

463
00:59:31,697 --> 00:59:34,547
They all will be educated
in the abbey.

464
00:59:37,967 --> 00:59:43,787
When Holy Christ takes his place in
their hearts, we'll have an army.

465
00:59:44,132 --> 00:59:49,822
Great.
Turks trained for killing Turks.

466
00:59:51,041 --> 00:59:54,051
I've never heard a better sentence.

467
00:59:55,569 --> 00:59:57,832
I'm bowing down before you.

468
00:59:57,832 --> 00:59:59,612
Me and the devil.

469
01:00:01,981 --> 01:00:03,181
Guys...

470
01:00:03,303 --> 01:00:05,813
To our little dangerous army.

471
01:00:21,001 --> 01:00:24,621
They set their eyes on the future
of my tent.

472
01:00:33,149 --> 01:00:35,689
I will scratch their eyes out.

473
01:00:51,516 --> 01:00:54,326
They backstabbed my tent.

474
01:01:01,644 --> 01:01:04,094
I will stab this on their back!

475
01:01:11,585 --> 01:01:14,435
If they try to steal our kids...

476
01:01:19,403 --> 01:01:21,973
...who are our roots...

477
01:01:30,376 --> 01:01:33,166
I will hurl my arrows at them!

478
01:02:00,104 --> 01:02:01,444
My Gonca.

479
01:02:11,335 --> 01:02:14,055
She is burning, Kumral Abdal,
do something.

480
01:02:15,778 --> 01:02:17,728
Her wound is deep, my Boran.

481
01:02:19,992 --> 01:02:21,752
We'll pray.

482
01:02:24,195 --> 01:02:26,155
My Gonca will be okay, right?

483
01:02:27,450 --> 01:02:28,930
She will.

484
01:02:31,575 --> 01:02:33,595
Gonca Hatun is strong.

485
01:02:41,572 --> 01:02:43,102
Come up.

486
01:02:47,863 --> 01:02:50,133
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim
(With the name of Allah, the merciful, the compassionate)

487
01:02:50,451 --> 01:02:52,431
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim
(With the name of Allah, the merciful, the compassionate)

488
01:03:38,927 --> 01:03:40,857
My Gonca.

489
01:03:42,418 --> 01:03:43,878
My Bala.

490
01:03:44,716 --> 01:03:46,916
You are going to be okay, sister.

491
01:03:47,724 --> 01:03:49,824
You are going to be okay.
She will.

492
01:03:53,533 --> 01:03:55,243
Don't, my Bala.

493
01:03:55,723 --> 01:03:57,353
Don't.

494
01:04:02,128 --> 01:04:04,308
I am the end of the way.

495
01:04:07,668 --> 01:04:10,248
There is no end. The way is eternal, girl.

496
01:04:10,924 --> 01:04:13,034
Do not let my half go away.

497
01:04:13,791 --> 01:04:15,871
You are going to be okay.

498
01:04:16,257 --> 01:04:18,677
Our Ahmet will be here safe and sound.

499
01:04:19,072 --> 01:04:21,422
Our children will grow up together.

500
01:04:33,130 --> 01:04:35,330
I couldn't protect you, my Gonca.

501
01:04:36,024 --> 01:04:37,404
I couldn't.

502
01:04:38,108 --> 01:04:39,888
Give me your blessings.

503
01:04:40,756 --> 01:04:42,686
I do, my Bala.

504
01:04:43,574 --> 01:04:45,174
I do.

505
01:04:50,311 --> 01:04:51,711
You'd do the same...

506
01:04:53,364 --> 01:04:55,384
...if it was you.

507
01:05:15,802 --> 01:05:17,152
Boran.

508
01:05:19,006 --> 01:05:20,426
My Gonca.

509
01:05:38,899 --> 01:05:41,619
Can I come in, my Bey?

510
01:05:41,855 --> 01:05:43,475
Come.

511
01:05:57,166 --> 01:05:59,506
We found this on Bilecik way, my Bey.

512
01:06:08,225 --> 01:06:10,985
Our valiants left us a track.

513
01:06:20,620 --> 01:06:22,810
Tell Alps to mount.

514
01:06:23,518 --> 01:06:25,598
We are going to Rogatus.

515
01:06:27,032 --> 01:06:28,912
As you command, my Bey.

516
01:06:40,089 --> 01:06:41,629
Bahadir Alp.

517
01:06:42,552 --> 01:06:46,332
Why did Malhun Hatun stop as soon as
I entered the tent?

518
01:06:46,600 --> 01:06:48,460
What does she hide from me?

519
01:06:48,567 --> 01:06:50,363
Does she suspect me?

520
01:06:50,363 --> 01:06:53,193
Malhun Hatun wanted me to observe you.

521
01:06:55,434 --> 01:06:57,704
She suspects me.

522
01:07:02,086 --> 01:07:03,736
It's because of you.

523
01:07:04,376 --> 01:07:06,276
You caused this.

524
01:07:06,865 --> 01:07:08,995
Oh my stupid head.

525
01:07:09,413 --> 01:07:11,868
I believed you, fell for the gold!
What have I done?

526
01:07:11,868 --> 01:07:14,048
Gokce, don't worry.

527
01:07:14,394 --> 01:07:18,404
I talked to her. I said
"Gokce cares for you...

528
01:07:19,662 --> 01:07:21,672
...she wouldn't harm you."

529
01:07:21,931 --> 01:07:24,591
- So calm down.
- How can I?

530
01:07:24,632 --> 01:07:28,822
Gonca is wounded because of me!
They won't let me live if they figure out!

531
01:07:29,780 --> 01:07:32,960
I didn't know it'd be this much

532
01:07:33,068 --> 01:07:34,560
You tricked me!

533
01:07:34,560 --> 01:07:37,580
Just calm down.
Do not reveal yourself.

534
01:07:37,911 --> 01:07:39,348
I'll handle the rest.

535
01:07:39,348 --> 01:07:41,388
Of course you'll handle the rest.

536
01:07:42,191 --> 01:07:44,461
If something happens to me...

537
01:07:45,238 --> 01:07:48,748
I am not going down alone.
You will as well.

538
01:08:17,081 --> 01:08:19,345
Bilecik Castle.

539
01:08:19,345 --> 01:08:21,995
Why did you invite me, Rogatus?

540
01:08:23,154 --> 01:08:26,224
Lords are now in cooperation, Turgut Bey.

541
01:08:28,053 --> 01:08:31,853
The agreement you signed with Kosses
involves all of us.

542
01:08:32,792 --> 01:08:33,921
It is.

543
01:08:34,348 --> 01:08:36,048
Cut to the chase.

544
01:08:38,184 --> 01:08:41,014
I have a caravan which is about
to enter this land.

545
01:08:41,122 --> 01:08:44,323
It carries belongings of all of
the Lords.

546
01:08:44,956 --> 01:08:48,786
It is your job to protect that caravan
according to our agreement.

547
01:08:50,348 --> 01:08:54,028
Will you be able to protect
no matter who crosses your way?

548
01:08:54,673 --> 01:08:57,483
Our promise is our honor, Rogatus.

549
01:08:58,877 --> 01:09:01,658
Your caravan will be at your castle
in time.

550
01:09:37,185 --> 01:09:38,716
Osman Bey.

551
01:09:41,127 --> 01:09:42,777
Turgut Bey.

552
01:09:43,987 --> 01:09:46,277
What are you doing in Lord's Castle?

553
01:09:46,957 --> 01:09:50,487
I am doing trade for
the welfare of my tent.

554
01:10:15,934 --> 01:10:17,624
Stop!

555
01:10:44,056 --> 01:10:45,766
Rogatus!

556
01:10:46,018 --> 01:10:48,568
Osman Bey, why are you here?

557
01:10:49,128 --> 01:10:52,548
Are you trying to stop our trade
with Turgut Bey becau...

558
01:10:52,548 --> 01:10:53,868
Shut up!

559
01:10:57,454 --> 01:11:01,244
I am here to ask you about the
kidnapped children of Turkmens.

560
01:11:02,163 --> 01:11:06,943
I am here to warn you about what will
happen to the ignobles who...

561
01:11:07,172 --> 01:11:10,192
...raided my tent, murdered my Alps.

562
01:11:13,092 --> 01:11:16,932
Cutting the hand which raises
to us is our tradition.

563
01:11:17,283 --> 01:11:21,353
Blunting the swords which are
pointing us is our tradition!

564
01:11:22,886 --> 01:11:26,606
The castles and the armored soldiers...

565
01:11:27,716 --> 01:11:32,856
nothing can protect you from my wrath!

566
01:11:38,023 --> 01:11:41,433
I will decorate my flags with your heads!

567
01:11:42,366 --> 01:11:45,646
You can't hold me responsible
for everything happening to you.

568
01:11:46,534 --> 01:11:48,274
I don't have any children.

569
01:11:50,785 --> 01:11:55,785
Watch your mouth among my armed soldiers.

570
01:11:59,710 --> 01:12:02,200
How do you think you'll get out of here?

571
01:12:19,731 --> 01:12:23,971
Act now if you can.

572
01:12:27,066 --> 01:12:30,296
Raise your sword if you are brave enough!

573
01:12:31,865 --> 01:12:33,435
Come on!

574
01:12:34,477 --> 01:12:38,277
A Turk has no difference from a wolf.

575
01:12:38,902 --> 01:12:40,732
A Turk is sharper than a sword!

576
01:12:42,671 --> 01:12:46,041
I am Osman Bey,
the son of Ertugrul Ghazi.

577
01:12:46,622 --> 01:12:48,362
Come on!

578
01:12:49,348 --> 01:12:51,388
Act now!

579
01:12:56,482 --> 01:12:57,852
However...

580
01:12:59,406 --> 01:13:02,406
However, you are not brave
enough to kill me.

581
01:13:06,492 --> 01:13:11,702
I will get out of this castle with
taking what I wanted with me.

582
01:13:13,348 --> 01:13:16,458
Just like a wolf getting out of sheepfold.

583
01:14:24,177 --> 01:14:26,207
I am not going to kill you...

584
01:14:26,365 --> 01:14:30,445
Those Turkmen kids who you love so much
will do it, Osman.

585
01:14:32,781 --> 01:14:37,326
When they become a Christian,
they'll face you.

586
01:14:37,326 --> 01:14:40,436
We'll see if you can talk like that
when that time comes.

587
01:14:41,028 --> 01:14:42,758
I wonder if you can.

588
01:14:55,970 --> 01:14:57,520
Boran.

589
01:14:57,647 --> 01:14:59,117
Yes, my rose?

590
01:14:59,559 --> 01:15:01,119
Boran.

591
01:15:01,324 --> 01:15:02,954
I am here, my Gonca.

592
01:15:04,853 --> 01:15:06,453
Water.

593
01:15:07,132 --> 01:15:08,602
Water.

594
01:15:16,538 --> 01:15:18,348
Hold on, my rose.

595
01:15:18,490 --> 01:15:19,790
Come.

596
01:15:22,204 --> 01:15:24,364
Bismillahirrahmanirrahim.
(With Allah's name, the merciful, the compassionate.)

597
01:15:50,409 --> 01:15:53,639
My Gonca, you are still burning.
I'll inform Kumral Abdal.

598
01:15:53,753 --> 01:15:55,183
Boran.

599
01:15:58,850 --> 01:16:00,770
Don't leave Boran Alp.

600
01:16:01,589 --> 01:16:03,319
Don't leave Boran.

601
01:16:10,786 --> 01:16:12,396
Don't leave.

602
01:16:20,449 --> 01:16:22,319
The time has come.

603
01:16:30,520 --> 01:16:32,200
The time has come.

604
01:16:34,778 --> 01:16:36,418
However...

605
01:16:37,465 --> 01:16:39,055
I know that...

606
01:16:40,390 --> 01:16:42,400
This is not the end.

607
01:16:42,489 --> 01:16:45,409
No, my Gonca, no.

608
01:16:49,716 --> 01:16:51,796
My Boran...

609
01:16:51,907 --> 01:16:53,417
My rose.

610
01:16:55,044 --> 01:16:57,394
Give me your blessings.

611
01:17:03,162 --> 01:17:05,502
I loved you so much, Boran.

612
01:17:06,418 --> 01:17:08,058
My Gonca.

613
01:17:08,967 --> 01:17:11,677
Don't, please, my other half.

614
01:17:11,754 --> 01:17:15,694
It's not time yet.
We were going to have good days.

615
01:17:17,296 --> 01:17:20,796
Don't leave me early.
Don't leave me, my other half.

616
01:17:22,449 --> 01:17:24,299
Boran.

617
01:17:26,849 --> 01:17:29,559
I am happy to have you, Boran.

618
01:17:30,236 --> 01:17:31,606
Please...

619
01:17:32,977 --> 01:17:35,367
...don't wear yourself down.

620
01:17:37,372 --> 01:17:39,132
My life...

621
01:17:39,407 --> 01:17:41,147
ends here.

622
01:17:42,378 --> 01:17:44,928
My world is you.

623
01:17:45,074 --> 01:17:47,214
What am I to do?

624
01:18:06,402 --> 01:18:08,542
- Bala!
- Daughter.

625
01:18:08,748 --> 01:18:10,528
Bala are you okay?

626
01:18:12,073 --> 01:18:14,033
Don't leave me my Gonca.

627
01:18:14,661 --> 01:18:16,381
Don't.

628
01:18:19,218 --> 01:18:21,468
Gonca.

629
01:18:23,871 --> 01:18:25,681
Gonca.

630
01:18:30,001 --> 01:18:32,171
I'll check on Gonca, mother.

631
01:18:32,814 --> 01:18:35,653
Mother, Gonca is getting worse.
Come.

632
01:18:35,773 --> 01:18:37,173
Come.

633
01:18:37,448 --> 01:18:39,378
Gonca!

634
01:18:40,938 --> 01:18:43,358
- Mother.
- My Gonca.

635
01:18:43,535 --> 01:18:46,345
My Gonca! My Gonca!

636
01:18:48,074 --> 01:18:51,513
My Gonca!

637
01:19:14,559 --> 01:19:16,869
"I bear witness that...

638
01:19:21,687 --> 01:19:23,837
...there is no deity but Allah...

639
01:19:26,416 --> 01:19:29,136
...and I bear witness that...

640
01:19:29,476 --> 01:19:31,506
...Muhammad is...

641
01:19:32,848 --> 01:19:37,138
...the messenger of Allah."

642
01:19:45,254 --> 01:19:47,544
My Gonca!

643
01:19:48,454 --> 01:19:50,474
My Gonca!

644
01:20:05,828 --> 01:20:07,538
My Gonca!

645
01:20:40,606 --> 01:20:43,456
Mother! Mother! Mother!

646
01:20:43,833 --> 01:20:46,263
Gonca sister has gone to the other side.

647
01:23:55,320 --> 01:23:56,970
Boran.

648
01:24:06,485 --> 01:24:07,945
My Bey!

649
01:24:09,362 --> 01:24:11,592
My Gonca has gone
to the other side, my Bey.

650
01:24:24,116 --> 01:24:26,616
May her shahada be blessed, brother.

651
01:24:31,671 --> 01:24:33,601
May her shahada be blessed.

652
01:24:34,459 --> 01:24:35,959
Amin my Bey.

653
01:24:54,376 --> 01:24:55,856
My Bey...

654
01:24:57,096 --> 01:24:59,386
They won't find peace.

655
01:25:01,270 --> 01:25:03,030
They won't.

656
01:25:05,214 --> 01:25:07,174
Of course they won't.

657
01:25:08,664 --> 01:25:13,454
No one who bothers Turks
will live long!

658
01:25:18,691 --> 01:25:20,431
Our sister Gonca...

659
01:25:23,029 --> 01:25:26,779
...has reached the holy position
that we all want.

660
01:25:32,085 --> 01:25:33,605
However...

661
01:25:36,426 --> 01:25:39,326
Do not count martyrs as dead.

662
01:25:42,392 --> 01:25:44,612
Now listen to me carefully.

663
01:25:45,348 --> 01:25:47,818
When we die...

664
01:25:49,050 --> 01:25:51,760
we fall to the ground as a martyr.

665
01:25:52,203 --> 01:25:56,573
But those infidels...

666
01:25:58,052 --> 01:26:00,352
will just be carcases for ravens!

667
01:26:03,943 --> 01:26:06,323
Your tears shall be...

668
01:26:08,051 --> 01:26:11,251
for the longing of our sister Gonca,
who has gone to heaven.

669
01:26:13,536 --> 01:26:15,696
Not for the pain...

670
01:26:16,532 --> 01:26:18,562
...not for the crisis...

671
01:26:19,341 --> 01:26:20,881
...not for...

672
01:26:21,849 --> 01:26:24,909
...especially not for her death.

673
01:26:28,469 --> 01:26:30,259
I am...

674
01:26:31,371 --> 01:26:34,231
I am Osman Bey, the son of Ertugrul Ghazi.

675
01:26:35,510 --> 01:26:37,600
I swear that...

676
01:26:38,627 --> 01:26:41,857
I will not let Gonca and other martyrs!

677
01:26:47,362 --> 01:26:52,682
That ignoble who infiltrated in our tent,
who murdered our alps...

678
01:26:54,087 --> 01:26:57,037
...is the one who kidnapped our children.

679
01:26:58,762 --> 01:27:01,212
We'll find them, brother.

680
01:27:01,989 --> 01:27:04,009
We'll find them.

681
01:27:06,461 --> 01:27:09,431
You'll be the one who takes revenge.

682
01:27:18,648 --> 01:27:20,958
Bilecik Castle.

683
01:27:34,854 --> 01:27:37,254
Ahmet, I am starving, brother.

684
01:27:37,419 --> 01:27:40,099
Hang in there, brother.

685
01:27:42,624 --> 01:27:45,114
We will warm up if we sit close.

686
01:27:47,448 --> 01:27:48,448
Come.

687
01:28:16,523 --> 01:28:18,123
Open it.

688
01:28:31,050 --> 01:28:33,057
What do you want, devil?

689
01:28:33,057 --> 01:28:36,217
We'll have some fun, little mice!

690
01:28:42,587 --> 01:28:44,921
Let go of my brother!

691
01:28:44,921 --> 01:28:47,111
Let go of him!
Let go of my brother!

692
01:28:49,785 --> 01:28:52,045
Let go! Let go!

693
01:28:53,065 --> 01:28:56,085
Let me go!
Let me go!

694
01:28:56,737 --> 01:28:59,167
Let me go!
Let go of my brother!

695
01:28:59,731 --> 01:29:02,871
Let go of me, ignobles!

696
01:29:03,657 --> 01:29:05,196
Where are you taking us?

697
01:29:05,196 --> 01:29:07,676
We are taking you to hell.

698
01:29:07,793 --> 01:29:10,253
Let go!
Let go!

699
01:29:10,899 --> 01:29:12,569
Let go!

700
01:29:44,880 --> 01:29:47,070
Let go of us!
Ignobles!

701
01:29:47,119 --> 01:29:49,429
Where are you taking us?
Let go of us, infidels!

702
01:29:49,646 --> 01:29:51,016
Let go!

703
01:29:51,016 --> 01:29:53,396
Stop it, you little mouse!

704
01:29:55,665 --> 01:29:58,278
Let go of us!

705
01:30:01,698 --> 01:30:04,278
Let go of us!
Ignobles!

706
01:30:10,599 --> 01:30:12,269
Let go of us!

707
01:30:28,150 --> 01:30:31,520
Welcome my beautiful boys.

708
01:30:58,148 --> 01:31:00,178
Don't get away from me.

709
01:31:00,258 --> 01:31:02,598
- Let go of me!
- Don't get away from me.

710
01:31:04,013 --> 01:31:05,393
Let go!

711
01:31:43,908 --> 01:31:47,168
I had a very delicious supper cooked
for you, kids.

712
01:31:48,040 --> 01:31:50,060
You are hungry, right?

713
01:31:54,330 --> 01:31:55,770
Come.

714
01:32:15,104 --> 01:32:16,904
Come.

715
01:32:28,828 --> 01:32:31,228
We are
Muslims alhamdulillah(praise be to Allah)

716
01:32:34,538 --> 01:32:36,758
We don't eat pork meat.

717
01:32:47,807 --> 01:32:50,757
What is your name, little man?

718
01:32:51,057 --> 01:32:52,997
My name is Osman Bey.

719
01:32:55,402 --> 01:32:59,292
I am a soldier, you cannot defeat me.

720
01:33:00,934 --> 01:33:03,810
My name is Osman Bey too.
I am a soldier.

721
01:33:03,810 --> 01:33:06,650
My name is Osman Bey too!
My name is Osman Bey too!

722
01:33:07,517 --> 01:33:10,117
You little mice!

723
01:33:39,245 --> 01:33:42,505
We have a long time ahead of us.

724
01:33:43,355 --> 01:33:44,695
I am going to...

725
01:33:46,627 --> 01:33:48,807
...teach you...

726
01:33:48,994 --> 01:33:51,844
...your real names one by one.

727
01:34:06,479 --> 01:34:09,819
Turgut Bey needs to pay for
having a deal with the infidels.

728
01:34:10,856 --> 01:34:14,416
While Turkmen children are kept
captive there...

729
01:34:14,845 --> 01:34:16,705
...it is inappropriate my Bey.

730
01:34:17,692 --> 01:34:20,812
Especially not when you banned
trading with infidels, my Bey.

731
01:34:21,605 --> 01:34:23,495
This is rebellion.

732
01:34:26,202 --> 01:34:28,542
Lords trust Turgut.

733
01:34:29,539 --> 01:34:32,899
They think only Turgut can
protect the caravan.

734
01:34:33,302 --> 01:34:36,642
Let's see if they can protect
their caravan from my wrath.

735
01:34:38,843 --> 01:34:41,853
Goktug, notify Alps.

736
01:34:42,133 --> 01:34:44,583
Notify everyone.

737
01:34:45,526 --> 01:34:48,609
We'll raid Turgut Bey's caravan.

738
01:34:48,609 --> 01:34:50,569
Yes my Bey.

739
01:35:35,326 --> 01:35:37,296
Now you may think that...

740
01:35:37,698 --> 01:35:39,458
...your sun went down...

741
01:35:40,468 --> 01:35:43,408
...that you are all alone in a dark night.

742
01:35:44,691 --> 01:35:46,241
Dark, right?

743
01:35:49,980 --> 01:35:54,330
You are not the only one
who took the pain...

744
01:35:57,280 --> 01:35:59,780
...you are experiencing in
darkness and cold...

745
01:36:03,760 --> 01:36:06,150
The universe is Allah's.

746
01:36:08,181 --> 01:36:11,241
He gave it to us, He is the One to take.

747
01:36:11,746 --> 01:36:13,716
The people are Allah's.

748
01:36:14,343 --> 01:36:16,123
He tests us.

749
01:36:18,444 --> 01:36:22,494
Even the mighty prophet was tested
with this pain.

750
01:36:26,426 --> 01:36:29,146
It was a dark night just like tonight.

751
01:36:31,092 --> 01:36:33,902
First, his uncle Abu Talib.

752
01:36:34,070 --> 01:36:36,150
Then his Khadīja.

753
01:36:38,741 --> 01:36:41,011
The one who believed in him first.

754
01:36:42,325 --> 01:36:44,785
The one who served him.

755
01:36:48,311 --> 01:36:51,331
The one who he leaned on.

756
01:36:55,422 --> 01:36:58,002
Hadrat Khadīja was sick.

757
01:37:00,431 --> 01:37:03,281
Our mighty prophet was crying on her side.

758
01:37:07,471 --> 01:37:10,211
I'd sacrifice myself for his tear!

759
01:37:14,327 --> 01:37:16,437
Our Mother Khadīja...

760
01:37:17,132 --> 01:37:19,982
...heard that Abu Talib deceased.

761
01:37:21,119 --> 01:37:25,619
She tried to relieve our beloved prophet
while she was sick!

762
01:37:27,596 --> 01:37:30,976
My beautifully named, lovely himself,
Mohammed is crying!

763
01:37:31,403 --> 01:37:34,843
He was crying for his uncle!
He was crying for his Khadīja.

764
01:37:35,799 --> 01:37:40,249
He was crying so loudly that
people from outside the room could hear!

765
01:37:40,940 --> 01:37:44,410
Mecca was crying, Medina was crying.

766
01:37:46,502 --> 01:37:49,312
Of course you can cry too, my Boran.

767
01:37:54,566 --> 01:37:59,256
The secret is revealed.
The secret is revealed.

768
01:38:00,046 --> 01:38:02,536
Cry my Boran, cry.

769
01:38:03,425 --> 01:38:05,315
Cry so much that...

770
01:38:06,300 --> 01:38:10,410
...your tears shall put out your
burning heart.

771
01:38:13,615 --> 01:38:15,945
The secret is revealed.

772
01:38:16,439 --> 01:38:18,689
Can a heart bear this separation?

773
01:38:20,321 --> 01:38:23,121
My Gonca has gone to the other side.

774
01:38:23,645 --> 01:38:27,675
The Holy Creator summoned,
how could we tell her not to go?

775
01:38:29,849 --> 01:38:33,979
This is the secret.
Adam is not made only of soil.

776
01:38:35,491 --> 01:38:37,441
He is made of pain too.

777
01:38:38,442 --> 01:38:41,422
Our humanity is assessed
by the pain we can bear.

778
01:38:43,879 --> 01:38:45,999
Cry my Boran, cry.

779
01:38:47,289 --> 01:38:48,759
Cry.

780
01:38:53,147 --> 01:38:55,367
Harmankaya Castle.

781
01:39:05,582 --> 01:39:07,332
Nestor.

782
01:39:12,742 --> 01:39:15,282
You were my right hand.

783
01:39:17,474 --> 01:39:19,304
My confidant..

784
01:39:19,377 --> 01:39:22,167
My most trusted man.

785
01:39:24,949 --> 01:39:27,169
Do not doubt that...

786
01:39:28,497 --> 01:39:35,917
I will make them pay. They crossed
the line when they attacked and killed...

787
01:39:35,917 --> 01:39:39,122
...you in our own land.

788
01:39:42,723 --> 01:39:44,853
I swear.

789
01:39:54,770 --> 01:39:56,550
Samuel!

790
01:40:01,472 --> 01:40:05,602
I want Nestor to be buried
with a knight ceremony!

791
01:40:05,772 --> 01:40:07,179
As you command.

792
01:40:07,179 --> 01:40:09,439
Then you'll go to Sogut.

793
01:40:10,030 --> 01:40:13,740
You'll take the Greek fire to
Priest Gregor.

794
01:40:19,355 --> 01:40:20,925
Sogut...

795
01:40:21,471 --> 01:40:24,101
will burn like hell!

796
01:40:51,997 --> 01:40:53,587
My Gonca...

797
01:40:59,408 --> 01:41:02,538
You are safer there
now that you are martyr.

798
01:41:09,155 --> 01:41:12,905
You migrated, left me with this pain.

799
01:41:24,903 --> 01:41:28,563
I am going to slaughter our enemy...

800
01:41:28,563 --> 01:41:30,617
...with this pain.

801
01:41:34,784 --> 01:41:38,034
For each day you are in grave...

802
01:41:38,524 --> 01:41:42,544
...I will kill one of them.

803
01:41:57,588 --> 01:42:00,208
I'll start with that ignoble first.

804
01:42:03,373 --> 01:42:05,223
I swear that...

805
01:42:05,634 --> 01:42:07,934
...her blood will be the first to shed.

806
01:42:37,876 --> 01:42:40,756
My Bey, take me with you.

807
01:42:46,372 --> 01:42:47,732
Boran.

808
01:42:48,082 --> 01:42:49,712
Go back to the tent.

809
01:42:50,535 --> 01:42:51,975
Lament.

810
01:42:55,921 --> 01:42:58,611
This is my lament, my Bey.

811
01:42:59,527 --> 01:43:02,487
Lamenting before taking my revenge
is haram for me!

812
01:43:02,934 --> 01:43:04,894
Hey Masha Allah!

813
01:43:05,918 --> 01:43:08,328
That's my valiant!

814
01:43:10,907 --> 01:43:12,477
Off we go!

815
01:44:13,214 --> 01:44:15,084
Osman Bey.

816
01:44:32,539 --> 01:44:34,759
You disobey me...

817
01:44:34,941 --> 01:44:38,261
you trade with the ones who hurt me.

818
01:44:38,742 --> 01:44:40,802
Not only you...

819
01:44:41,241 --> 01:44:43,321
I was hurt too.

820
01:44:44,842 --> 01:44:49,053
Consider yourself as a leader, command
all the other Beys...

821
01:44:49,053 --> 01:44:52,133
And if someone doesn't listen,
raid their caravan. Is that it?

822
01:44:52,224 --> 01:44:54,524
It's not only about the caravan...

823
01:44:54,688 --> 01:44:57,138
not only about the trade...

824
01:44:58,704 --> 01:45:00,676
It's about your betrayal.

825
01:45:00,676 --> 01:45:05,366
I do not betray, Osman Bey.
I do what I do for my tent.

826
01:45:42,152 --> 01:45:44,162
Come on now.

827
01:49:21,976 --> 01:49:23,876
Alps!

828
01:50:01,540 --> 01:50:03,170
What is it, Osman Bey?

829
01:50:03,489 --> 01:50:05,879
Why are we meeting here?

830
01:50:06,651 --> 01:50:09,721
- As cautionary.
- Tell me.

831
01:50:10,268 --> 01:50:14,268
- How will we save those kids?
- That's why we are here.

832
01:50:15,906 --> 01:50:18,966
Lords should think you're on their side...

833
01:50:19,728 --> 01:50:23,728
so that we can save kids.

834
01:50:24,808 --> 01:50:28,808
We live in tents. We
can move.

835
01:50:29,806 --> 01:50:32,636
However, this castle is not it.

836
01:50:32,771 --> 01:50:37,741
That's why there is a secret passage.

837
01:50:40,317 --> 01:50:44,317
I know where the secret passage is in the
Bilecik Castle.

838
01:50:48,818 --> 01:50:51,168
It's next to the kitchen.

839
01:50:58,008 --> 01:51:02,728
However, you will open it for us.

840
01:51:03,353 --> 01:51:07,353
I will go into their castle...

841
01:51:08,221 --> 01:51:10,821
to open the passage.

842
01:51:11,226 --> 01:51:12,866
Yes.

843
01:51:15,329 --> 01:51:20,459
We will play a trick on them so that
they will believe you.

844
01:51:45,448 --> 01:51:47,528
Are you okay, my Bey?

845
01:51:50,150 --> 01:51:52,140
I am.

846
01:51:54,078 --> 01:51:55,228
Come on.

847
01:51:59,488 --> 01:52:02,628
I will make you pay for it, Osman Bey.

848
01:52:03,774 --> 01:52:06,334
A valiant like him can stop Osman.

849
01:52:06,409 --> 01:52:10,849
I didn't believe him when Rogatus said
that. We're safe now.

850
01:52:15,791 --> 01:52:19,481
Come on.
We are going to Bilecik.

851
01:52:19,974 --> 01:52:21,704
Come on.

852
01:52:46,400 --> 01:52:48,520
Won't you eat?

853
01:52:50,637 --> 01:52:53,227
I think you should eat.

854
01:52:54,928 --> 01:52:58,818
You'll be on a diet in Hristos
Monastery anyway.

855
01:52:58,932 --> 01:53:02,212
What Monastery are you
talking about, infidel?

856
01:53:16,656 --> 01:53:19,716
A good Christian monk always eats less.

857
01:53:21,485 --> 01:53:24,485
I'm sure you won't be having a hard time.

858
01:53:37,664 --> 01:53:41,244
Drink.
Drink it!

859
01:53:49,044 --> 01:53:53,044
We all have a holy tree in our
hearts, rising to the sky.

860
01:53:53,700 --> 01:53:57,050
You can't harm that tree whatever you do.

861
01:53:57,436 --> 01:53:59,976
You can't change us.

862
01:54:00,249 --> 01:54:02,579
Don't be so sure, little Turk.

863
01:54:02,714 --> 01:54:07,314
They will be fine even if you
bury the Turks here!

864
01:54:08,007 --> 01:54:11,707
We were born as a Turk, we will
die as a Turk!

865
01:54:11,842 --> 01:54:30,812
We were born as a Turk, we will
die as a Turk!

866
01:54:31,879 --> 01:54:34,469
You didn't have to come that far.

867
01:54:34,545 --> 01:54:38,155
I wanted to be sure that the
caravan is safe.

868
01:54:38,390 --> 01:54:42,390
Do you think Turgut Bey can
handle it?

869
01:54:42,567 --> 01:54:46,567
Turgut is a powerful and
wise man, Rogatus.

870
01:55:06,279 --> 01:55:08,549
Welcome, Turgut Bey.

871
01:55:10,758 --> 01:55:14,918
Welcome, Turgut Bey. We have been
waiting for you.

872
01:55:17,685 --> 01:55:20,525
I kept my promise.

873
01:55:22,342 --> 01:55:25,952
The caravan is safe.

874
01:55:37,785 --> 01:55:40,165
Turgut Bey.

875
01:55:44,277 --> 01:55:46,477
You're hurt.

876
01:55:51,332 --> 01:55:56,212
Turgut Bey!

877
01:55:57,415 --> 01:56:00,705
- Why are you waiting? Call the doctor!
- Soldiers! Call the doctor!

878
01:56:00,881 --> 01:56:03,941
Carry him to the room.

879
01:56:05,196 --> 01:56:08,656
Turgut Bey.
Slowly.

880
01:56:10,860 --> 01:56:13,570
Slowly.

881
01:56:22,153 --> 01:56:25,193
Osman Bey, bey of Kayı, attacked the
caravan and hurt him.

882
01:56:25,446 --> 01:56:29,446
Turgut Bey protected
our goods with his life.

883
01:56:34,619 --> 01:56:39,409
So, Turgut Bey fought
Osman for us.

884
01:56:42,166 --> 01:56:45,396
You're not as stupid as I think you are.

885
01:56:45,963 --> 01:56:49,073
You side with the powerful ones.

886
01:56:54,745 --> 01:56:58,745
The kids should go to Monastery and
get educated as soon as possible!

887
01:56:59,454 --> 01:57:03,994
Turks are going to end Turks. These
kids should grow up fast.

888
01:57:05,998 --> 01:57:08,408
The kids are going to
the Monastery, Nikola.

889
01:57:08,595 --> 01:57:11,845
They are not going to the order
of Hospitallers. (knights templar)

890
01:57:12,320 --> 01:57:16,170
Firstly, Christianity must
touch their hearts deeply.

891
01:57:16,226 --> 01:57:22,456
And then? All of these kids will become
deathsmen fighting for Christianity.

892
01:57:22,532 --> 01:57:26,242
It's their fate.

893
01:57:26,315 --> 01:57:30,555
However, a good Christian must
hate Turks firstly.

894
01:57:30,673 --> 01:57:35,653
- Söğüt will burn!
- Yes, it will.

895
01:57:43,372 --> 01:57:48,012
Those kids will grow up and then
Osman... Osman...

896
01:57:49,318 --> 01:57:54,348
first Osman and then all of the Turks
in those lands will die.

897
01:57:55,218 --> 01:57:58,628
Osman can't deal with these.

898
01:57:59,505 --> 01:58:02,425
He's destined to die.

899
01:58:09,329 --> 01:58:12,172
Everything's fine for now.

900
01:58:13,082 --> 01:58:15,852
However, we don't know for sure
what will happen at night.

901
01:58:15,863 --> 01:58:17,903
We'll go into the enemy's castle.

902
01:58:19,014 --> 01:58:22,774
It will be so dangerous. Everybody should
take measures.

903
01:58:22,844 --> 01:58:26,844
We will do anything for you, my Bey.

904
01:58:27,476 --> 01:58:30,186
Your way is our way, my Bey.

905
01:58:30,268 --> 01:58:35,718
My Bey, show us a target and we
will attack like a wolfpack.

906
01:58:36,627 --> 01:58:41,517
Mashallah!

907
01:58:41,740 --> 01:58:44,670
A Turk is not scared of dying.

908
01:58:44,924 --> 01:58:49,754
Now, we will take our kids back!

909
01:58:51,314 --> 01:58:54,514
- Come on!
- Your command, my Bey.

910
01:59:22,050 --> 01:59:25,540
- Turgut Bey.
- Mari.

911
01:59:32,669 --> 01:59:36,309
Are you okay? I'm worried.

912
01:59:36,766 --> 01:59:40,286
You don't have to worry.
It's not a severe wound.

913
01:59:41,102 --> 01:59:45,102
What you did is praiseworthy.
You fought for us.

914
01:59:45,207 --> 01:59:50,557
Not for you, I did it to keep my promise.

915
01:59:58,824 --> 02:00:01,174
Your arm is bleeding.

916
02:00:06,768 --> 02:00:09,188
The doctor tightened it.
You must be hurt.

917
02:00:09,463 --> 02:00:13,033
You don't know about
wounds, Byzantine beauty.

918
02:00:16,767 --> 02:00:19,057
Is it okay?

919
02:00:20,430 --> 02:00:23,040
Does it hurt?

920
02:00:27,739 --> 02:00:31,739
- You do it intentionally.
- No. Never.

921
02:00:32,974 --> 02:00:37,594
I owe you a life. I don't ever want
to hurt you.

922
02:00:59,151 --> 02:01:02,431
Where's the Priest?
Is there a problem?

923
02:01:02,445 --> 02:01:05,515
We should be careful.

924
02:01:06,204 --> 02:01:08,204
Is it the Greek fire? (incendiary weapon)

925
02:01:08,204 --> 02:01:11,784
A gift from Lord Kosses to the Priest.

926
02:01:46,660 --> 02:01:48,790
I hope Turgut Bey will succeed.

927
02:01:48,909 --> 02:01:51,799
He's all alone among all those soldiers.

928
02:01:53,120 --> 02:01:57,120
Turgut Bey is a good man.
He's brave.

929
02:01:57,651 --> 02:02:00,211
Of course, he will succeed.

930
02:02:01,679 --> 02:02:06,159
I will kill whoever took my
Gonca away from me.

931
02:02:06,974 --> 02:02:11,644
Of course I will kill that traitor
who hurt me.

932
02:02:13,265 --> 02:02:17,735
When we save the kids, they
will pay for it.

933
02:02:18,822 --> 02:02:20,662
All of them.

934
02:03:48,699 --> 02:03:52,699
The little Turks will go to the
place where they belong, soon.

935
02:05:16,881 --> 02:05:20,881
Look! The devils are coming.

936
02:05:22,574 --> 02:05:26,574
- What will we do, Ahmet Alp?
- My Osman Bey will save us.

937
02:05:26,877 --> 02:05:30,557
Let's gain some time.
Come on.

938
02:05:43,669 --> 02:05:48,169
Kids. How nice! You're all together.

939
02:05:50,668 --> 02:05:55,218
When I see you again, you will have
become good Christians.

940
02:05:59,093 --> 02:06:03,673
You didn't tell me your name but
I have a nice name for you.

941
02:06:05,176 --> 02:06:08,196
From now on, your name is Alex.

942
02:06:08,486 --> 02:06:13,496
Call me whatever you want! A Turk's name
may change but his blood never changes!

943
02:06:14,045 --> 02:06:18,155
Torture us if you want. You will
pay for it.

944
02:06:24,286 --> 02:06:31,056
"My Allah! Have mercy on our great
Muhammad and the Progeny of Muhammad."

945
02:07:07,770 --> 02:07:11,770
- Salam Alaikum.
- Alaikum Salam

946
02:07:34,089 --> 02:07:59,139
"My Allah! Have mercy on our great
Muhammad and the Progeny of Muhammad."

947
02:08:00,220 --> 02:08:03,900
I don't like this, kids. You'll do
what I say.

948
02:08:03,988 --> 02:08:06,738
I am losing my patience!

949
02:08:08,921 --> 02:08:22,121
"My Allah! Have mercy on our great
Muhammad and the Progeny of Muhammad."

950
02:09:48,416 --> 02:09:51,516
The dungeon is that way.

951
02:09:51,673 --> 02:09:55,673
Turgut Bey, stop.

952
02:09:57,120 --> 02:10:01,570
Go back to your place.

953
02:10:02,185 --> 02:10:06,185
Go back to your place so that they think
you're one of them.

954
02:10:13,173 --> 02:10:15,833
May your fight be holy, valiants.

955
02:10:15,935 --> 02:10:19,075
Thank you.

956
02:10:28,938 --> 02:10:32,656
Let me go!

957
02:10:32,656 --> 02:10:34,986
Is everything ready? I don't want any
trouble.

958
02:10:35,006 --> 02:10:37,259
Everything is ready.

959
02:10:38,123 --> 02:10:41,813
Where's Osman, whom you trust so much?

960
02:11:29,353 --> 02:11:33,353
Let me go!

961
02:12:43,076 --> 02:12:44,766
Let me go!

962
02:13:44,670 --> 02:13:46,410
Ahmet.

963
02:14:09,218 --> 02:14:10,988
Monastery.

964
02:14:13,589 --> 02:14:17,509
They are taking the kids to
the Hristos Monastery.

965
02:14:55,783 --> 02:15:00,193
Come on, Alps. They have the kids.
Hurry up.

966
02:15:00,270 --> 02:15:03,390
Okay, my Bey.

967
02:15:18,133 --> 02:15:22,133
I knew I shouldn't have trusted you in the
first place.

968
02:15:24,015 --> 02:15:29,485
I did everything to cure you but
you helped Osman.

969
02:16:26,241 --> 02:16:51,471
Please contact us for any inquiries
turkision@gmail.com